<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:50:04 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>人工智能、美联储担忧加剧看跌情绪，金属跌势加剧</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation</link><description>铜、铝和锡都加剧了周二金属的大幅抛售，因为科技股扩大了跌幅，交易员们为美国通胀数据做好准备，这些数据将为美联储下一步的利率举措提供依据。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation'&gt;人工智能、美联储担忧加剧看跌情绪，金属跌势加剧&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Metals Rout Deepens as AI, Fed Worries Fuel Bearish Sentiment&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/metals-mixed-after-major-selloff-as-traders-await-us-inflation</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 03:57:12 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Nvidia 仍面临市值损失 2 万亿美元的问题</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value</link><description>随着投资者开始认真思考仍然笼罩在这家全球最大芯片制造商身上的问题，英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋周一回归后，围绕该公司股价的乐观情绪正在消退。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value'&gt;Nvidia 仍面临市值损失 2 万亿美元的问题&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Nvidia Still Faces Issues That Cost $2 Trillion in Market Value&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/nvidia-still-faces-issues-that-cost-2-trillion-in-market-value</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:20:58 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</link><description>由于中东不断升级的袭击给近几个月该地区原油运输的复苏蒙上阴影，油价小幅走高。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25'&gt;11 月 25 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 25&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-25</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:06:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</link><description>黄金下跌，因为股市继续抛售，投资者等待关键的通胀数据，这可能会影响美联储进一步加息的预期。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets'&gt;通胀数据将引导美联储押注，金价下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Gold Slumps Below $3,500 an Ounce to Lowest in More Than a Year&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-24/gold-holds-decline-as-us-tariff-plans-reinforce-rate-hike-bets</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 23:51:22 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Bullrich 与米莱选举改革会议</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bullrich-confia-en-que-la-reforma-electoral-de-milei-sera-aprobada</link><description>帕特里夏·布尔里奇 (Patricia Bullrich) 表示，在阿根廷参议院对 PASO 的投票已足够，将改革 2027 年总统选举日程。（来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bullrich-confia-en-que-la-reforma-electoral-de-milei-sera-aprobada'&gt;Bullrich 与米莱选举改革会议&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bullrich confía en que la reforma electoral de Milei será aprobada&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/bullrich-confia-en-que-la-reforma-electoral-de-milei-sera-aprobada</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 12:45:52 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>